Figure 3 revealed the results in presence of 1% (w/w) bio-adsorbent. Although by passing 30 days the main part of Nickel
contents from vegetable leaves were significantly decreased (p < 0.01), after 40 days the 70% removal of initial concentration of
Nickel were observed, that means so significant (p<0.001).




